","text":"今日は日本対セネガルの試合もあるので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"熱いですね～⚽"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サッカーそんなに詳しくないけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワールドカップ見ていて面白い…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日本を応援しましょう！📣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"see you later ✩*.ﾟ#27"}],"source":"official"}}